  "content": "<h1><span style=\"font-size:12px\">本模組為Macaw的橋樑/柵欄/屋頂/傢俱/樓梯與Abnormals團隊模組的多相容性擴充。</span></h1><p>本模組會自動使用其他模組的材料添加橋樑/屋頂或柵欄。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>我已安裝Macaw's Bridges - Abnormals，擔心安裝此模組會刪除所有已放置的橋樑。</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>請放心，本模組會自動轉換舊版相容模組中的所有方塊與物品。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>此為Macaw模組的非官方擴充，若發生崩潰或錯誤請至<strong><a href=\"https://github.com/Samlegamer/Macaw-s-Addons/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題回報區</a></strong>回報。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>支援模組：</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>- Macaw's Bridges（橋樑模組）</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1077/904/2025-01-25_22.png\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>- Macaw's Roofs（屋頂模組）</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1077/905/2025-01-25_22.png\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>- Macaw's Fences（柵欄模組）</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1077/907/2025-01-25_22.png\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>- Macaw's Furnitures（傢俱模組）</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1077/909/2025-01-25_22.png\"></p>\n</div><p><br>- Macaw's Stairs（樓梯模組）</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1077/915/2025-01-25_22.png\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><em>1.1版更新內容</em></strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1102/857/2025-02-20_11.png\"></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><br>必要依存項目：</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/addonslib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>AddonsLib</strong></a></p><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blueprint\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Blueprint</strong></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">選用依存項目：</span></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sketch_macaw/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw系列模組</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Abnormals系列支援：</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>- <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/buzzier-bees\" rel=\"nofollow\">Buzzier Bees</a></strong></p><p><strong>- <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/environmental\" rel=\"nofollow\">Environmental</a></strong></p><p><strong>- <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgrade-aquatic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Upgrade Aquatic</a></strong></p><p><strong>- <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/autumnity\" rel=\"nofollow\">Autumnity</a></strong></p><p><strong>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/endergetic\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Endergetic Expansion</a></strong></p><p><strong>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/atmospheric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Atmospheric</a></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/caverns-and-chasms\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caverns &amp; Chasms</a></strong></span></p>",
